{"id":"two-hop-positive","theory":"The key is red. Every red thing is hot. Every hot thing is unsafe.","query":"Is the key unsafe?","query_atom":"unsafe(key)","answer":"TRUE","depth":2,"gold_msp":"+red(key)\nr1:red(?x)=>hot(?x)\nr2:hot(?x)=>unsafe(?x)","tags":["deduction","two-hop"]}
{"id":"two-hop-explicit-negative","theory":"The rod is metal. Every metal thing is conductive. Everything conductive is not insulating.","query":"Is the rod insulating?","query_atom":"insulating(rod)","answer":"FALSE","depth":2,"gold_msp":"+metal(rod)\nr1:metal(?x)=>conductive(?x)\nr2:conductive(?x)=>!insulating(?x)","tags":["explicit-negation","two-hop"]}
{"id":"open-world-unknown","theory":"Robin is a bird. Every bird can fly.","query":"Is Robin blue?","query_atom":"blue(robin)","answer":"UNKNOWN","depth":0,"gold_msp":"+bird(robin)\nr1:bird(?x)=>flies(?x)","tags":["open-world","unknown"]}
{"id":"conjunction","theory":"The token is blue. The token is round. Anything that is both blue and round is marked.","query":"Is the token marked?","query_atom":"marked(token)","answer":"TRUE","depth":1,"gold_msp":"+blue(token)\n+round(token)\nr1:blue(?x)&round(?x)=>marked(?x)","tags":["conjunction"]}
{"id":"negative-premise","theory":"Worker 7 is permitted. Worker 7 is not blocked. Any permitted worker that is not blocked is schedulable.","query":"Is worker 7 schedulable?","query_atom":"schedulable(worker_7)","answer":"TRUE","depth":1,"gold_msp":"+permitted(worker_7)\n+!blocked(worker_7)\nr1:permitted(?x)&!blocked(?x)=>schedulable(?x)","tags":["explicit-negation","conjunction"]}
{"id":"binary-chain","theory":"Ada follows Bo. Bo follows Cy. If one person follows a second person and that second person follows a third, then the first can reach the third.","query":"Can Ada reach Cy?","query_atom":"reachable(ada,cy)","answer":"TRUE","depth":1,"gold_msp":"+follows(ada,bo)\n+follows(bo,cy)\nr1:follows(?x,?y)&follows(?y,?z)=>reachable(?x,?z)","tags":["binary-relation","join"]}
{"id":"three-hop","theory":"Node a is raw. Every raw node becomes parsed. Every parsed node becomes indexed. Every indexed node becomes searchable.","query":"Is node a searchable?","query_atom":"searchable(node_a)","answer":"TRUE","depth":3,"gold_msp":"+raw(node_a)\nr1:raw(?x)=>parsed(?x)\nr2:parsed(?x)=>indexed(?x)\nr3:indexed(?x)=>searchable(?x)","tags":["deduction","three-hop"]}
{"id":"rule-direction","theory":"Every square is blue. Shape q is blue.","query":"Is shape q square?","query_atom":"square(shape_q)","answer":"UNKNOWN","depth":0,"gold_msp":"+blue(shape_q)\nr1:square(?x)=>blue(?x)","tags":["no-converse"]}
{"id":"no-contraposition","theory":"Every safe package is signed. Package p is not signed.","query":"Is package p not safe?","query_atom":"!safe(package_p)","answer":"UNKNOWN","depth":0,"gold_msp":"+!signed(package_p)\nr1:safe(?x)=>signed(?x)","tags":["no-contraposition"]}
{"id":"negative-conclusion","theory":"Item z is revoked. Every revoked item is not valid.","query":"Is item z valid?","query_atom":"valid(item_z)","answer":"FALSE","depth":1,"gold_msp":"+revoked(item_z)\nr1:revoked(?x)=>!valid(?x)","tags":["explicit-negation"]}
{"id":"variable-join-filter","theory":"Mira owns file a. File a is sensitive. Anyone who owns something sensitive requires clearance.","query":"Does Mira require clearance?","query_atom":"requires_clearance(mira)","answer":"TRUE","depth":1,"gold_msp":"+owns(mira,file_a)\n+sensitive(file_a)\nr1:owns(?x,?y)&sensitive(?y)=>requires_clearance(?x)","tags":["binary-relation","join"]}
{"id":"irrelevant-distractor","theory":"Device x is online. Every online device is reachable. Device y is encrypted. Every encrypted device is protected.","query":"Is device x protected?","query_atom":"protected(device_x)","answer":"UNKNOWN","depth":0,"gold_msp":"+online(device_x)\nr1:online(?x)=>reachable(?x)\n+encrypted(device_y)\nr2:encrypted(?x)=>protected(?x)","tags":["distractor","unknown"]}
